m."]},{"code":111,"params":[1,137,0,1,0]},{"code":122,"indent":1,"params":[137,137,1,0,1]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@niko Aren't you tired being up this late?"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@shepherd I do not sleep."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@shepherd Count as many sheep as I have, and you become immune to it."]},{"code":111,"params":[1,137,0,0,0]},{"code":122,"indent":1,"params":[137,137,1,0,1]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@niko_speak So is this why you had to leave?"]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"params":["@shepherd No, I left because my ramen was getting cold."]},{"code":209,"params":[0,{"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"list":[{"code":41,"parameters":[{"String":"green_npc_misc"},{"Integer":0},{"Integer":2},{"Integer":1}]},{"code":35,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"parameters":[]}]}]}]}]},{"id":93,"name":"Gamer RAM","x":79,"y":64,"pages":[{"list":[]},{"condition":{"switch1":431},"list":[{"code":122,"params":[4,4,0,0,1]}]}]},{"id":94,"name":"warm room","x":45,"y":68,"pages":[{"list":[{"code":121,"params":[69,69,0]},{"code":126,"params":[14,1,0,1]},{"code":122,"params":[1,1,0,0,0]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak Seems like the warmth robot is still here!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_warm I can feel the warmth all the way out here..."]},{"code":209,"params":[-1,{"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"list":[{"code":29,"parameters":[{"Integer":4}]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"parameters":[]}]}]},{"code":210},{"code":112},{"code":111,"indent":1,"params":[12,"Script.px >= 51"]},{"code":113,"indent":2},{"code":209,"indent":1,"params":[-1,{"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"list":[{"code":3,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"parameters":[]}]}]},{"code":210,"indent":1},{"code":413},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Hello friend.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko2 Oh..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak Hello!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Are you seeking shelter from the cold?]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak Nope, just visiting!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Visitors are welcome as well.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [I've been getting a lot of visitors since the snow fell.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Some warm up and leave, others stay and chat.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Some simply come by to nervously play their harmonica.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_warm I guess I could use a little warm up..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak And a chat is nice too!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko5 But actually, I hoped maybe you'd be asleep so I could quietly leave you a gift..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [How kind of you, to leave a gift for someone you barely know.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko2 Yeah but\\..\\..\\..\\. \\@niko_speak I do remember you!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_eyeclosed Even though I don't even know your name..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Kelvin.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [And you must be Niko, correct?]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak Yeah!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Some of my visitors talked a lot about you, mostly among themselves.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [About how you restored the sun, and brought hope to them.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak But it wasn't just me!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak \\p was with me, and everyone helped!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_eyeclosed I wouldn't have made it far on my own..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_upset Honestly, I didn't really do much, I was just carrying the sun and doing what \\p told me to do..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_upset And sometimes..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_upset2 Sometimes I think maybe it'd be better  if someone else was there instead of me..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_upset2 Someone who knew what to do..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Hmm...]"]},{"code":106,"params":[20]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [It matters not who could've been in your stead.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [You were there, and you've fulfilled your duty as messiah, have you not?]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_upset2 Yeah..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Then I believe you were the right person for the job.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [You've heeded the guidance of others, where some might've stubbornly attempted forcing their way.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [It is a rare quality, as far as I can tell.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko2 What? \\>\\n\\@niko3 But isn't that what you're supposed to do when you don't know something?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [Sometimes people have a hard time admitting they're wrong or don't know something, and just listening.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko5 Huh..."]},{"code":106,"params":[40]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [You said there was a gift?]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko2 Oh, \\|\\@niko_speak Yeah!"]},{"code":209,"params":[-1,{"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"list":[{"code":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":3,"parameters":[]},{"code":3,"parameters":[]},{"code":3,"parameters":[]},{"code":19,"parameters":[]},{"code":15,"parameters":[{"Integer":8}]},{"code":0,"parameters":[]}]}]},{"code":210},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak These are cat toys, so you can also play with the cats!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [How thoughtful, thank you!]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [I am certain the cats are grateful as well.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_smile And thank you too! \\>\\n\\@niko_speak For the warmth, and what you said!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@kelvin [My pleasure.]"]},{"code":249,"params":[{"name":"get_item","volume":50,"pitch":150}]}]},{"condition":{"switch1":69},"list":[{"code":123,"params":["A",0]},{"code":117,"params